# purffle-grab
===
 Free open-source YouTube downloader & Spotify playlist downloader for Windows, Mac & Linux. YouTube to MP3/MP4 up to 4K, Spotify playlists to MP3/FLAC with cover art. Built-in audio player, equalizer, format converter. No ads, no signup.
